{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google與藍色起源公司宣佈，將於2029年第一季度使用「新格倫」重型運載火箭，把搭載Google自研張量處理單元的AI伺服器衞星送入太空。這次發射將成為Google「陽光捕手」項目首次專門的重型運載發射，也是該公司把AI數據中心推向太空計劃的重要一步。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587130.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:38:45.572341+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:22:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:02.032232+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:02.032232+00:00","content_hash":"bd6765beb98b6922dcf4f8a730ec733cbee7b65f32988faee6c18c4be36d7788","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}